text":"제품\u0027인지","x":1280,"y":1624,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"의미가","x":1398,"y":1624,"width":80,"height":30}]},{"text":"애매모호해질 수 있다. 엔터E-I의 이름을 업무 목적에 따라 생성되는 자연스러운 이름을 부여해야 하는데 이와","words":[{"text":"애매모호해질","x":166,"y":1671,"width":156,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":336,"y":1673,"width":26,"height":28},{"text":"있다.","x":375,"y":1672,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"엔터E-I의","x":446,"y":1672,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"이름을","x":561,"y":1673,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"업무","x":649,"y":1673,"width":51,"height":30},{"text":"목적에","x":712,"y":1674,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"따라","x":801,"y":1674,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"생성되는","x":865,"y":1673,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"자연스러운","x":981,"y":1673,"width":130,"height":30},{"text":"이름을","x":1124,"y":1673,"width":78,"height":29},{"text":"부여해야","x":1214,"y":1671,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"하는데","x":1331,"y":1670,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"이와","x":1424,"y":1672,"width":53,"height":29}]},{"text":"상관없이 임의로 부여하면, 프로젝트에서 커뮤니케이션 오류 문제를 야기할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"상관없이","x":166,"y":1718,"width":102,"height":32},{"text":"임의로","x":286,"y":1718,"width":79,"height":29},{"text":"부여하면,","x":378,"y":1720,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"프로젝트에서","x":504,"y":1720,"width":152,"height":29},{"text":"커뮤니케이션","x":673,"y":1721,"width":153,"height":30},{"text":"오류","x":841,"y":1722,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"문제를","x":906,"y":1720,"width":78,"height":30},{"text":"야기할","x":999,"y":1719,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":1091,"y":1720,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":1132,"y":1719,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"전문가 7h1드 45","words":[{"text":"전문가","x":1277,"y":2058,"width":55,"height":24},{"text":"7h1드","x":1341,"y":2058,"width":55,"height":24},{"text":"45","x":1422,"y":2060,"width":36,"height":26}]}]}